  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Your task is very simple: given two integers AAA and BBB, write a program to add these two numbers and output the sum.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains an integer TTT, the total number of test cases.\nThen follow TTT lines, each line contains two integers, AAA and BBB.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, add AAA and BBB and display the sum in a new line.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤10001 \\leq T \\leq 10001≤T≤1000",
      "0≤A,B≤100000 \\leq A, B \\leq 100000≤A,B≤10000"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "3\n1 2\n100 200\n10 40",
        "output": "3\n300\n50",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTestcase 1: 1+2=31 + 2 = 31+2=3. Hence the first output is 333.\nTestcase 2: 100+200=300100 + 200 = 300100+200=300. Hence the second output is 300300300."
      }
    ]
  },
